      },
      "message": "fix(motion): keep a multi-piece pocket's eroded area when no sliver drops\n\n`non_sliver_center` (#2383, for #2232) rebuilt every multi-piece cutter-\ncenter area through `Region::from_slices` even when its sliver scan dropped\nnothing. Clipper's normalisation restarts each loop at another vertex, so\nthe pass starts of multi-piece pockets moved: adaptive_entry_pieces'\nnarrow second piece started at (56, 6) instead of (56, 5) and the\npost-merge batch gate went red. Return the plain offset unchanged unless\na sliver is actually removed.\n\nFixes #2426\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
